  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      The better pay bands come from two hard rounds, not one. The first is a fresher offer from a product company or GCC. The second is the move at about three to five years, which has its own interview, so keep proof work going after you join.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--amber">
    <p>
      <strong>Scalable ownership route in both careers:</strong> freelance projects, consulting for small firms, or a small product built on your skill. It scales because you set the price and are not limited to one employer's hours or band. It needs proof of work and a simple way to find and win clients first.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3>If you try the independent route</h3>

